          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1628686079837_452954_92656"/>
          <body>the set of instances of ShapeElement from which the DerivedShapeElement is derived. &lt;note&gt;Cardinality of this set depends on the kind of derivation.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
