        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052700_635739_100394"/>
        <body>A DirectedToleranceZone is a type of ToleranceZoneWithDatum that represents an "intersection plane" for a geometric tolerance as defined in ISO 1101.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>DirectedToleranceZone</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717136386619_287534_132753" xmi:uuid="1caacc4a-2bb9-4930-a2fd-715c3fd0a40e" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717136405320_648810_132755" xmi:uuid="09febd37-aeab-4eba-b6e8-25ddbd9b5e83" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1717136386619_287534_132753"/>
          <body>if Angle is defined, the unit of Angle shall be a plane angle measure unit.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717136796248_298237_132775" xmi:uuid="488c4ae0-46fc-4fd6-b82a-57e53d6dabac" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717139990989_260762_132794" xmi:uuid="8b6265d2-ee12-4f53-ad00-c974f0245825" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='DirectedToleranceZone']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="unitRef" value="child::Angle/Unit/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not (Angle) or //Unit[@uid=$unitRef]/Quantity[(ClassString ='plane angle')]"&gt;(DirectedToleranceZone.WR1 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) if Angle is defined, the unit of Angle shall be a plane angle measure unit.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052700_635739_100394"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717136386620_73459_132754" xmi:uuid="89100d42-1b86-4700-9d49-2f5821842885" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>not (self.Angle.oclIsUndefined()) implies (self.Angle.Unit.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::Unit).Quantity.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::ClassStringProxy).value = 'plane angle')</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052883_285653_101250" xmi:uuid="f83b72dc-379b-43d9-85fa-fc9f86cc24b4" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052884_216443_101275"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052853_299350_100938" xmi:uuid="6beb8215-388c-401f-812a-de6d1bc3203d" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1607002097929_695974_94017" xmi:uuid="dc6e4b77-25bd-4c36-8c87-4584d6761c07" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052853_299350_100938"/>
          <body>specifies the direction of the tolerance zone in respect to the referenced datum. It is either perpendicular, parallel or including.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Direction</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052817_393664_100875"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052935_929053_101990"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1609841632797_392258_91431" xmi:uuid="dcf353bf-b30f-4efc-9673-61cfc550d8b4" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1609841719616_692962_91435" xmi:uuid="f8969422-d1b3-4d31-902f-4223586dd063" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1609841632797_392258_91431"/>
          <body>specifies the angle of the plane. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Angle</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193283_976319_23905"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1609842199963_326360_91507" xmi:uuid="64551244-366d-4428-a54e-a1b96491ff88" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1609841735417_153292_91436"/>
