          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1628684251417_984045_92487"/>
          <body>the constant distance between the OffsetShapeElement and the shape element instance that is the value of DerivedFrom. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
