          <body>defines if the ShapeElement is part to the definition of the overall shape of the AssemblyViewRelationship, BreakdownElementView, IndividualPartView, Occurrence, PartView, ProductConfiguration, ShapeFeatureDefinition or another ShapeElement. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
