        <body>A ToleranceZoneWithDatum is a type of DirectedOrOrientedToleranceZone that includes direction or orientation classification with respect to referenced features. &lt;note&gt;Typically only a primary datum is used.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>ToleranceZoneWithDatum</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052859_396877_101080" xmi:uuid="c80f2ffe-7c4e-476b-95eb-9fff7147a5a4" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
