          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052703_244678_100492"/>
          <body>specifies that for the relating ShapeElement the centre shall be used and for the related ShapeElement the outer boundary shall be used.</body>
        </ownedComment>
