        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052700_739724_100398"/>
        <body>A TargetStraightLine is a type of PlacedTarget that specifies a DatumTarget that is defined by an implicit straight line. The first end point of the TargetStraightLine is specified by the placing AxisPlacement. The second end point is located on the z-axis of the AxisPlacement at the specified distance.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>TargetStraightLine</name>
