    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052813_730737_100787" xmi:uuid="81dc58b6-2596-4426-8668-8636be89d1c1" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1606999708325_287436_93551" xmi:uuid="f43b0f58-2177-457d-affd-0452a05630b4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052813_730737_100787"/>
        <body>A CylindricityTolerance is a type of GeometricTolerance. It constrains the form of a cylindrical feature. Unless otherwise specified, the rules governing cylindricity tolerance defined in ISO 1101 shall apply. &lt;note&gt;Alternatively cylindricity tolerance can be used according to the specifications given in ASME Y14.5&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>CylindricityTolerance</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052938_561746_102074" xmi:uuid="05b44556-bfec-4f07-b2f8-77dccb8f8b14" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052786_418916_100634"/>
      </generalization>
    </packagedElement>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052956_761524_102717" xmi:uuid="8337d0f8-094a-4a75-93ae-dcdfb8785259" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1607000866568_423979_93993" xmi:uuid="6d009707-681a-4ea6-b753-e10294009a98" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052956_761524_102717"/>
        <body>A DimensionalLocation is a type of GeometricDimension that represents the specification of the distance or angle that one feature is displaced from another feature. A DimensionalLocation specifies that a spatial constraint exists between two ShapeElements that are represented as a non-directed measure applied along a measurement path. &lt;note&gt;Representation of a ShapeElement participating in the DimensionalLocation relationship implies a measuring direction for the DimensionalLocation through the related and relating ShapeElement. The meaning of the direction is specified in an application protocol.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt;The application and use of DimensionalLocation and DimensionalSize are shown in the Figure &lt;caption&gt;Dimensional location and dimensional size&lt;/caption&gt;.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;The short edge of a plate is located 90 degrees relative to the long edge.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;example&gt;The centre of the hole is 10 centimetres from the short edge.&lt;/example&gt; A DimensionalLocation is either an AngularLocation or a CurvedDistance, or a LinearDistance. &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;dimensional_location_and_size.gif&lt;/name&gt;Dimensional location and dimensional size&lt;/figure&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>DimensionalLocation</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052701_622624_100426" xmi:uuid="43bb6a3d-6ed3-4824-9bd7-6e9030851cbe" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052934_893030_101947"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1687265397972_930197_153097" xmi:uuid="7652a4c5-aab7-480c-9505-4170fa09b6a5" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052936_895137_102029"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052935_587236_101978" xmi:uuid="e7cf2627-40be-48dc-a10b-aab8cb2a5c27" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052910_261465_101644"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052810_945116_100688" xmi:uuid="fcacb98f-1645-4f1c-8e0a-9063a572406f" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052948_181723_102443"/>
      </generalization>
      <isAbstract>true</isAbstract>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052948_55463_102438" xmi:uuid="8a77f2df-1174-4cc8-ae59-df513076c766" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1607000878826_164235_93994" xmi:uuid="74a0d0e9-4fee-4ba9-8a0d-9003cd4ce204" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052948_55463_102438"/>
          <body>the text or the set of texts that provide further information about the DimensionalLocation. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Description</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193068_300298_23514"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052807_580061_100639" xmi:uuid="380c05ab-8fbe-4b29-996e-86b20a788874" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052810_106851_100704"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052886_855470_101341" xmi:uuid="543991e1-4e73-4645-9711-be7c26c94008" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1607000948431_55647_93995" xmi:uuid="de6558d5-c975-47a2-a717-6f020c29170c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052886_855470_101341"/>
          <body>a Boolean value designating the importance of direction for measuring a DimensionalLocation. If the value is 'true' the DimensionalLocation is measured from origin to target. A value of 'false' indicates that the direction for measuring the DimensionalLocation is inconsequential. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Directed</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../../../../DataTypes.xmi#BOOLEAN"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052882_481798_101208" xmi:uuid="9a0b7b90-6e6d-4d92-8b52-5b4ba84bfa84" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052886_810989_101333" xmi:uuid="e8819792-c564-4d9b-9802-c35dd18b573d" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1607000957317_12361_93996" xmi:uuid="cc3fa7fb-6d4b-4d24-81e5-9b4a0ed43637" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052886_810989_101333"/>
          <body>the element that is the origin for the DimensionalLocation.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Origin</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../ShapeAssociationAndStructure/ShapeAssociationAndStructure.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193242_442446_23839"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052884_776228_101269"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052699_932201_100373" xmi:uuid="799e2b97-4337-4f12-ba91-ec4c2bd495d3" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1607000973847_426079_93997" xmi:uuid="5b26b794-0b15-4511-8009-0e19ec60a81a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052699_932201_100373"/>
          <body>the element that is the target for the DimensionalLocation.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Target</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../ShapeAssociationAndStructure/ShapeAssociationAndStructure.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193242_442446_23839"/>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052941_609221_102184"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
    </packagedElement>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1609841959912_764363_91446" xmi:uuid="85375ca5-998a-4bb4-ab0d-ee234fee87a9" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1609842191312_314821_91506" xmi:uuid="c6320ff8-8b41-4e39-b77e-11f4ff317a3f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1609841959912_764363_91446"/>
        <body>A DirectionFeatureToleranceZone is a type of ToleranceZoneWithDatum that represents a "direction feature" for a geometric tolerance as defined in ISO 1101. </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>DirectionFeatureToleranceZone</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1677074104975_281308_154358" xmi:uuid="4c949681-fe8f-4a2e-a262-608c73bab98e" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1677074156633_274696_154363" xmi:uuid="6ec90f07-0b0c-4044-8553-0ae38786e4e6" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1677074104975_281308_154358"/>
          <body> the unit of Angle shall be a plane angle measure unit. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1677074189250_924255_154370" xmi:uuid="c6dfa371-95c6-4d91-a6d4-9955ee83c53f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1677074202833_679645_154371" xmi:uuid="fd9c0897-d54e-4990-aa2a-4622e891c98d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='DirectionFeatureToleranceZone']/Angle"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="unitRef" value="./Unit/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="//Unit[@uid=$unitRef]/Quantity/ClassString ='plane angle'"&gt;(DirectionFeatureToleranceZone &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) The unit of Angle shall be a plane angle measure unit. &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1609841959912_764363_91446"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1677074104976_309268_154359" xmi:uuid="9d6be37e-a194-46cd-a0b0-4bce713acac9" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.Angle.Unit.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::Unit).Quantity.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::ClassStringProxy).value ='plane angle'</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1609842022531_80932_91491" xmi:uuid="fb86c7ff-e9be-480c-a5b2-d7948d080635" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052884_216443_101275"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1609842116969_352193_91498" xmi:uuid="d8b6c5b5-7f9f-4154-bfe1-fece0c93474a" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1614330339255_73391_90578" xmi:uuid="2c910dae-e3cd-4dad-af21-e255b81bcbe2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1609842116969_352193_91498"/>
          <body>specifies the width of the tolerance zone according to the direction. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Angle</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type href="../CommonResources/CommonResources.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193283_976319_23905"/>
        <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1609842135868_445916_91504" xmi:uuid="408d5ef9-90cb-436e-a8d5-55f6512fc936" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
        <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
        <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1609842130364_500698_91501"/>
      </ownedAttribute>
