        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052931_751542_101837"/>
        <body>A TargetArea is a type of DatumTarget that specifies an area bounded by a closed ShapeElement. The shape of the TargetArea is described explicitly by a set of curves with reference to the part coordinate system.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>TargetArea</name>
