        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052906_701069_101522"/>
        <body>A RadialSize is a type of DimensionalSize that is a radius of a circular, cylindrical, spherical, or toroidal feature.</body>
      </ownedComment>
