          <body>indicates that the toleranced feature specification element is the associated minimax (Chebyshev) feature in accordance with ISO 1101 unless otherwise specified; &lt;note&gt;The symbol for minimax (Chebyshev) feature is Ⓒ.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
