          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052951_433682_102564"/>
          <body>specifies the role of the ShapeElement for the CompositeShapeElement. There shall be two or more ShapeElements for a CompositeShapeElement.</body>
        </ownedComment>
