        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052913_348054_101737"/>
        <body>A Nominal3dFeature is a type of PartShapeElement that represents a three-dimensional nominal feature. Each Nominal3dFeature is either a Nominal3dIntegralFeature or a Nominal3dDerivedFeature.</body>
