    </packagedElement>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052882_464614_101226" xmi:uuid="ce493f1a-e1ee-4bf1-9ed4-bf2d41f21d17" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1606999746323_107128_93552" xmi:uuid="75b577b2-e4bd-4927-b63c-84eea034ac8f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052882_464614_101226"/>
        <body>A Datum is a type of ShapeElement from which dimensions and tolerances are referenced. This ShapeElement may, but need not, coincide with the boundary defining the product. A Datum is a datum as specified in ISO 5459. The application of Datum shall conform to the requirements of ISO 5459. &lt;note&gt;The use and application of a group of features to establish a Datum is identified in ISO 5459. The group of features is established by using ShapeElementRelationship objects. The concept of a group of ShapeElements is defined in CompositeShapeElement.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt;A Datum is a theoretically exact point, straight line, or plane used as a reference for locating and orienting tolerance zones.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Datum</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654696480400_888904_153329" xmi:uuid="4cd09f74-f64a-4423-8952-afdafa6653f3" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1655975655096_768237_149136" xmi:uuid="66eff543-af10-4a23-886c-05322799873e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654696480400_888904_153329"/>
          <body>The combination of Identification and ElementOf shall be unique within a population of datum.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1654868465388_55450_148363" xmi:uuid="d716064f-2919-4b4f-8a32-150214de6acb" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1654868519542_252572_148366" xmi:uuid="1f95dcec-79ae-403c-8c4a-b547f26f2f81" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='Datum']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="id" value="./Identification/IdentifierString"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="followingIds" value="(following-sibling::ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='Datum']/Identification/IdentifierString)"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="precedingIds" value="(preceding-sibling::ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='Datum']/Identification/IdentifierString)"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not (($id = $followingIds) or ($id = $precedingIds))"&gt; (Datum &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) The combination of Identification and ElementOf shall be unique within a population of datum. &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>UR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052882_464614_101226"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654696480400_192045_153330" xmi:uuid="ad8d91ed-400c-4775-aa86-552f0d5d3a3e" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>Datum::allInstances()-&gt;forAll( d2 | self &lt;&gt;d2 implies ( self.Identification.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::Identifier).Id &lt;&gt; d2.Identification.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::Identifier).Id or self.ElementOf &lt;&gt;d2.ElementOf ) )</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654781733889_614657_156340" xmi:uuid="556ecd7d-7388-4081-bf52-dd7a4ad538be" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1654870979659_834457_148517" xmi:uuid="4b6a5215-d8f7-4a71-8df3-8c078b3688ff" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1654870991731_759350_148518" xmi:uuid="32af412c-75ad-42f1-9dab-ea7089a30611" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='Datum']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="(count (./Targets) ge 1) or (count(//ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='DatumFeature']/OfDatum[@uidRef=$uid]) = 1)"&gt; (Datum &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) A datum shall be related to one or more DatumTargets or related to one DatumFeature. &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1655975662094_360512_149139" xmi:uuid="5d6220b3-af84-4f69-939f-2997630d989a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654781733889_614657_156340"/>
          <body>A datum shall be related to one or more DatumTargets or related to one DatumFeature.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052882_464614_101226"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654781733889_886408_156341" xmi:uuid="5f090a74-ae5c-4339-8240-4f612fa947cb" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.Targets -&gt; size() &gt;= 1 or DatumFeature::allInstances()-&gt;select(df| df.OfDatum = self) -&gt; size() =1</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1649679322701_470071_147191" xmi:uuid="77c03074-88b2-446c-bfdf-9697c44a1563" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1649679671022_711623_147201" xmi:uuid="365d3e62-5aff-4bf5-8e53-0e591a171523" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1649679322701_470071_147191"/>
          <body>TargetId shall be unique within a population of Targets.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1651755765702_328336_147034" xmi:uuid="ef4928ea-1751-4e98-8170-2c35a1785bc4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1651755779776_337893_147035" xmi:uuid="3b1b20a5-dcee-44e2-86ad-5f4e90116cdf" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='Datum']/Targets/DatumTarget"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uidRef" value="./@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="targetId" value="//ShapeElement[@uid=$uidRef]/TargetId/IdentifierString"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="following" value="(following-sibling::DatumTarget)/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="preceding" value="(preceding-sibling::DatumTarget)/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="targetIds" value="//ShapeElement[@uid=$following or @uid=$preceding ]/TargetId/IdentifierString"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="not ($targetId = $targetIds)"&gt; (Datum &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) TargetId (&lt;sch:value-of select="$targetId"/&gt;) shall be unique within a population of Targets. &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt; </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>UR2</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052882_464614_101226"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1649679322716_497460_147192" xmi:uuid="c3ce526a-f6c6-4078-bc5a-6ec9e60c6592" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.Targets -&gt;isUnique(t | t.TargetId.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::Identifier).Id)</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654781265508_134765_156207" xmi:uuid="d121a7ad-a109-45ce-b3fc-801745afd946" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1654870408084_522276_148439" xmi:uuid="4f11f77c-cbe4-4a4d-820d-3bdfa661fef5" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1654870423481_3122_148440" xmi:uuid="15c67b88-e707-4e08-9e06-3d344133ff8c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='Datum']"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="count(//ShapeElement[substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='DatumFeature']/OfDatum[@uidRef=$uid]) le 1"&gt; (Datum &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) There shall be at most one DatumFeature related to the Datum. &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1655975670018_531550_149142" xmi:uuid="b2a1b2dc-8e7c-4e21-8764-c935c9f5524f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654781265508_134765_156207"/>
          <body>There shall be at most one DatumFeature related to the Datum.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR2</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052882_464614_101226"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1654781265524_464350_156208" xmi:uuid="d9500c7a-5680-4629-832b-7bacb4e6ced6" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>DatumFeature::allInstances()-&gt;select(df| df.OfDatum = self) -&gt; size() &lt;=1</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
