          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1614677368732_748561_91135"/>
          <body>if specified, the FirstUnitSize shall be a value of a length measure or a value of plane angle measure.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1651764264996_497745_147377" xmi:uuid="99e251f3-17da-4595-8e7f-b9ff0bd524e1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1651764302952_970262_147380" xmi:uuid="ba40c79c-191e-4a6b-9cec-06e918c2fe0d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//GeometricTolerance/FirstUnitSize"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="unitRef" value="Unit/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="//Unit[@uid=$unitRef]/Quantity[(ClassString ='length' or ClassString ='plane angle')]"&gt;(GeometricTolerance &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) If specified, the FirstUnitSize shall be a value of a length measure or a value of plane angle measure. Unit &lt;sch:value-of select="$unitRef"/&gt; = &lt;sch:value-of select="//Unit[@uid=$unitRef]/Quantity/ClassString"/&gt; &lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt; </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
