          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052731_911955_100584"/>
          <body>the words or set of words by which the GeometricalTolerance is known. &lt;note&gt;This identification may be one of the geometrical tolerance types specified in ISO 1101 when used to represent International Standard geometrical tolerances.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;Position, straightness, concentricity, parallelism, circular runout, etc., are names for geometrical tolerance types.&lt;/example&gt; The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
