          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052702_337202_100443"/>
          <body>specifies the role of the GeometricToleranceModifier for the GeometricTolerance. There shall exist at least one GeometricToleranceModifier for the GeometricTolerance. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
