          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1601394052905_897205_101473"/>
          <body>a length of a segment that constrains how the tolerance applies. All along any segment of this size, taken on the toleranced element, the toleranced element shall conform to the tolerance. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
